<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Dear&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">[<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">Insert Name]</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">As you get closer to graduation, I want to personally thank you for your contributions to your high school's blood drive program. Your leadership helped save lives and inspired other students to support the Red Cross mission. I am so proud of you!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">There are many opportunities for you to continue your Red Cross journey after high school. You are a proven leader with a passion for helping others and we’d be honored if you would continue to support the Red Cross in the next chapter of your life.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><b><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Here are ways you can take the next step with the Red Cross:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><b><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/key/humankind.html"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Host blood drives</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;on your college campus or in your community.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Host&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/learn-about-hosting/why-host-a-blood-drive/leaders-save-lives.html"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Leaders Save Lives</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;blood drives while school is out of session.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Join or start a&nbsp;</span><a href="http://redcrossyouth.org/college-resources/"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Red Cross Club</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Donate blood</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;on your college campus or in your community.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://www.redcross.org/volunteer/become-a-volunteer.html"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Volunteer</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;with us.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: -0.25in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Explore&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.redcross.org/about-us/careers.html"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">job opportunities</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;at the Red Cross.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you again for your leadership and contributions to the Red Cross mission. I hope you will look back on this experience and be proud that you personally helped patients in need and continued the lifesaving tradition at your school. Please let me know if there’s anything I can do for you.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="normaltextrun">Sincerely,</span><span class="eop">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><br></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
